    {
      "text": "Rezoning from R-1-8 to R-1-8(PD), demolition of an existing single-family residence and eight two-story detached homes with a new private street off Roberts Avenue. Seven homes are about 2,660 sq ft (942 sq ft first floor, 1,225 sq ft second floor, 493 sq ft garage); the eighth is about 2,254 sq ft (898, 1,074 and 282 sq ft garage) with a 907 sq ft two-story ADU (2 bedrooms, 1.5 baths). About 18,725 sq ft of green space and landscaping.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Site plan lists Applicant/Owners c/o Pan-Cal Corporation, contact David Chui, and planner/engineer Wood Rodgers Inc., Pleasanton. City file PD24-005 includes removal of 21 ordinance-size trees.",
